### 프로필 사진 올리기
POST http://localhost:4002/api/avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatar-boundary

--avatar-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="beach.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../requests/photos/beach.jpg
--avatar-boundary--

### 1MB가 넘는 사진
POST http://localhost:4002/api/avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatar-boundary

--avatar-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="big.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../requests/photos/big.jpg
--avatar-boundary--

### 사진이 아닌 파일
POST http://localhost:4002/api/avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatar-boundary

--avatar-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="memo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../../requests/photos/memo.txt
--avatar-boundary--

### 이름을 photo로 보내기
POST http://localhost:4002/api/avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatar-boundary

--avatar-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="beach.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../requests/photos/beach.jpg
--avatar-boundary--
